              "text": "paulisper — \"for a little while\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Paulisper in tabernā mānsimus; deinde discessimus. We stayed in the shop for a little while; then we left."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It says how long, briefly. In Plautus a slave begs his master to wait paulisper."
            }
          ]
        },
